                <componentInstanceProperties>
                    <name>richTextValue</name>
                    <value>&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(127, 127, 127); font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The Highlights section within a CityView page provides details on our philanthropic investments, high-level programmatic activities, and interactions with prominent officials in that city. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(127, 127, 127); font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;﻿Highlights can answer the question: &lt;em&gt;If you were about to walk into a room with a mayor, what would you want to be aware of?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(127, 127, 127); font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;Below are the steps to submit your team&apos;s CityView Highlights. Note that your submission goes through a review and approval process. This may take up to one week (but often sooner) to show up within CityView.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;If your update is timely, make sure to add the CityView Highlight as early as possible and then contact Liza Rebold at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:Liza@bloomberg.org&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(53, 156, 215); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;Liza@bloomberg.org&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt; to review and publish.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(127, 127, 127); font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Use the top search box to search for the City;&amp;nbsp;click to open it&amp;nbsp;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;On the right-hand side of the City&apos;s page, click on the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;Organization Highlights/CityView&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;down arrow&amp;nbsp;and click &quot;New&quot;&amp;nbsp;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(127, 127, 127); font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Fill in the following fields on the page that&amp;nbsp;displays​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Team: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;choose your team or the &quot;on behalf of &quot; team you&apos;re entering for, if different&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Organization:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;This will be pre-filled with the&amp;nbsp;City&apos;s name&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;Subject:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;Brief title of the&amp;nbsp;CityView&amp;nbsp;Highlight&amp;nbsp;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;Interaction Date/Start Date&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;: Date the&amp;nbsp;CityView&amp;nbsp;Highlight started&amp;nbsp;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;Interaction Type&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;: ALWAYS choose &quot;Program&amp;nbsp;Highlight&quot; for all&amp;nbsp;CityView&amp;nbsp;entries&amp;nbsp;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;: Details about the&amp;nbsp;CityView&amp;nbsp;Highlight&amp;nbsp;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;Foundation Coding&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;: Find the appropriate coding using a keyword search (ex: &quot;Carbon&quot;)&amp;nbsp;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;Submit to&amp;nbsp;CityView&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;This checkbox&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;MUST&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;be&amp;nbsp;checked for your entry to be considered for&amp;nbsp;CityView&amp;nbsp;highlights!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Save:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;Click the green&lt;/u&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&apos;Save&apos;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;u style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;button at the&amp;nbsp;bottom of the page&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; color: rgb(127, 127, 127);&quot;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(127, 127, 127); font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;If you have any questions about CityView in general, please contact Lisa Rebold at &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:Liza@bloomberg.org&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(53, 156, 215); font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;Liza@bloomberg.org&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</value>
